    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's Institute for Educational Development, East Africa (IED, EA) is hosting its third   and final Foundations for Learning (F4L) Conference in Nairobi, Kenya. The event, which concludes a three-year, multi-country series that began in Tanzania in 2023 and continued in Uganda in 2024, celebrates the project's achievements and looks to the future of education in East Africa.",
